ed Kingdom and other Commonwealth realms from 6 February 1952 until her death in 2022. She was queen regnant of 32 sovereign states during her lifetime and was the monarch of 15 realms at her death. Her reign of 70 years and 214 days is the longest of any British monarch, the second-longest of any sovereign state, and the longest of any queen regnant in history.\nElizabeth was born in Mayfair, London, during the reign of her paternal grandfather, King George V. She was the first child of the Duke and Duchess of York (later King George VI and Queen Elizabeth the Queen Mother).","image":"Queen Elizabeth II official portrait for 1959 tour (retouched) (cropped) (3-to-4 aspect ratio).jpg","birth":1926.3013698630136,"death":2022.6849315068494}},"media":{"Flag of Grenada.svg":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bc/Flag_of_Grenada.svg/330px-Flag_of_Grenada.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Grenada.svg","author":"See file history below for details.","license":"Public domain"},"Coat of arms of Grenada.svg":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Coat_of_arms_of_Grenada.svg/330px-Coat_of_arms_of_Grenada.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Coat_of_arms_of_Grenada.svg","author":"Sodacan","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},"King Charles III (July 2023).jpg":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ac/King_Charles_III_%28July_2023%29.jpg/330px-King_Charles_III_%28July_2023%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:King_Charles_III_(July_2023).jpg","author":"White House","license":"Public domain"},"Prime Minister of Grenada Mr. Dickon Mitchell.jpg":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Prime_Ministe